<!-- 01 PROBLEM -->
<section id="problem" class="nv-hero"><img class="nv-hero-bg" src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1jE95g8QjG5Dcg4ppNWHbuS_5B9R9eVI6&amp;sz=w2400" alt="Naya Power" loading="eager"><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-hero-copy nv-reveal"><div class="nv-k">01 · THE PROBLEM</div><h1 class="nv-h1">AI got powerful.<br><span class="nv-serif">Working with it</span> didn't.</h1><p class="nv-lead">Most AI gives you an answer and leaves you holding the bag. You repeat yourself. Rebuild context. Check the work. Remember what failed. Decide what happens next.</p><div class="nv-hero-actions"><a class="nv-btn mag" href="#revelation">SEE THE DIFFERENCE <span>→</span></a><a class="nv-btn" href="#capabilities">WHAT NAYA POWER DOES</a></div><div class="nv-live"><i></i> INTELLIGENCE SHOULD CREATE MOMENTUM</div></div></div></section>

<!-- 02 REVELATION -->
<section id="revelation" class="nv-section nv-purple"><span class="nv-index">02</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid"><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">THE REVELATION</div><h2 class="nv-h2">We didn't need more AI.<br><span class="nv-serif">We needed better intelligence.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya Power is built around a simple shift: intelligence should become more useful over time. It should know where you are, what you were doing, what happened, what failed, what matters, and what should happen next.</p><div class="nv-big"><h3>Less wasted intelligence. More useful intelligence.</h3><p>The system is designed to turn conversations into continuity, actions into verified outcomes, and experience into intelligence that compounds.</p></div></div><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1MhbTLZRwC1bQwvsKir4LWacsWkH-E-dF&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Shawn and Naya" loading="lazy"></div></div></section>

<!-- 03 WHAT IS NAYA POWER -->
<section id="what" class="nv-section nv-white"><span class="nv-index">03</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">WHAT IS NAYA POWER?</div><h2 class="nv-h2">An intelligence operating system<br>for <span class="nv-serif">humans and AI.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya Power is not another chatbot and not another pile of AI tools. It is the operating layer that helps intelligence remember, reason, act, verify, learn, and improve.</p><div class="nv-value"><div><strong>CONTINUITY</strong><span>Keep the important context instead of starting over.</span></div><div><strong>RESPONSIBILITY</strong><span>Move from answers toward decisions and action.</span></div><div><strong>VERIFICATION</strong><span>Check reality instead of trusting what merely looks finished.</span></div><div><strong>COMPOUNDING</strong><span>Turn experience into intelligence that helps the next interaction.</span></div></div></div></section>

<!-- 04 DIFFERENCE -->
<section id="difference" class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">04</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">THE DIFFERENCE</div><h2 class="nv-h2">From chatbot<br>to <span class="nv-serif">operating partner.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">A chatbot waits for the next question. Naya Power is designed around your mission and the outcome you are trying to create.</p><div class="nv-flow"><div>UNDERSTAND</div><div>DECIDE</div><div>ACT</div><div>VERIFY</div><div>LEARN</div><div>IMPROVE</div><div>COMPOUND</div></div><div class="nv-big"><h3>Do it again — better.</h3><p>The loop does not end when an answer appears. It ends when the outcome is understood, verified, and used to make the next attempt stronger.</p></div></div></section>

<!-- 05 BRAIN -->
<section id="brain" class="nv-section nv-white"><span class="nv-index">05</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid"><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1CsGTxgHFeXfn-nlazrJCenfnsijQ5t-t&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Naya" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">NAYA'S BRAIN</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Naya turns on her brain<br><span class="nv-serif">before she thinks.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Before responding, the system should be able to orient itself around the work.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>Current state — where are we right now?</li><li>Mission — what are we actually trying to accomplish?</li><li>Prior work — what has already been done?</li><li>Decisions and rules — what has already been established?</li><li>Blocker — what is preventing progress?</li><li>Next action — what creates the most useful momentum?</li></ul></div></div></section>

<!-- 06 HAND -->
<section class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">06</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid rev"><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1m6QSnwfTwgMV2Qmh-7zuJY5BZmjXaKJV&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Human and Naya working together" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">SHE DOESN'T JUST ANSWER</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Naya takes<br><span class="nv-serif">the hand.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">The point is not to produce another paragraph. The point is to help the human move.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>Understand what matters.</li><li>Recommend the strongest next move.</li><li>Create the thing.</li><li>Execute the action.</li><li>Verify what actually happened.</li><li>Keep the work moving.</li></ul><div class="nv-quote">“The goal isn't another answer. The goal is the outcome.”</div></div></div></section>

<!-- 07 STOP -->
<section class="nv-section nv-purple"><span class="nv-index">07</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid"><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">SHE KNOWS WHEN TO STOP</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Intelligence shouldn't become<br><span class="nv-serif">an expense machine.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya Power treats time, money, attention, compute, and human energy as resources worth protecting.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>Don't retry just because the last attempt failed.</li><li>Retry when there is new evidence, a new hypothesis, a corrected implementation, or a changed strategy.</li><li>When progress stalls: stop, diagnose, learn, and change the approach.</li></ul><div class="nv-big"><h3>STOP → DIAGNOSE → LEARN → CHANGE</h3><p>Failure is not permission to waste more resources. It is information that should change the next move.</p></div></div><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1fmOICJBaG6QHN20gMMiSgA--xBnK9eGg&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Human intelligence and AI" loading="lazy"></div></div></section>

<!-- 08 MEMORY -->
<section id="memory" class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">08</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid rev"><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1GPbAnIz83ktAyUeqJ8qEer_1yJsxZRJ6&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Hemasonics" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">MEMORY THAT COMPOUNDS</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Turn your life<br><span class="nv-serif">into intelligence.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Meaningful moments should not disappear into yesterday's chat history. Smart Notes capture the things that deserve to improve tomorrow.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>Breakthroughs</li><li>Decisions</li><li>Mistakes</li><li>Lessons</li><li>Ideas</li><li>Questions</li><li>Goals, wins, opportunities, and discoveries</li></ul></div></div></section>

<!-- 09 MEMORY TO INTELLIGENCE -->
<section class="nv-section nv-white"><span class="nv-index">09</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">FROM MEMORY TO INTELLIGENCE</div><h2 class="nv-h2">One experience.<br><span class="nv-serif">Many future advantages.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Smart Note → Intelligent Feed → Compounding Intelligence. The objective is not simply to remember more. It is to become more capable because you lived, learned, and used the system.</p><div class="nv-flow"><div>DAY 1</div><div>DAY 2</div><div>DAY 7</div><div>DAY 30</div><div>DAY 365</div><div>LIFETIME</div><div>COMPOUND</div></div><div class="nv-big"><h3>Your past work becomes part of your future intelligence.</h3><p>That is the compounding layer: experience becomes context, context becomes intelligence, and intelligence improves what happens next.</p></div></div></section>

<!-- 10 VERIFY -->
<section id="verify" class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">10</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid"><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">VERIFY REALITY</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Looking finished<br>isn't the same as <span class="nv-serif">being finished.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya Power uses a reality check: SOURCE → BUILD → DEPLOY → PUBLIC RUNTIME → OBSERVE → VERIFY.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>Source intent is not runtime truth.</li><li>A build is not a deployment.</li><li>A deployment is not proof that a public user can actually use it.</li><li>Observation closes the gap between “I think it works” and “I know it works.”</li></ul><div class="nv-quote">“Don't tell me the car is finished. Start the engine.”</div></div><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1K6c_1lV6A6xQSEYedV47jt3rGhF1y_OD&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Worldwide listening centre" loading="lazy"></div></div></section>

<!-- 11 FAILURE -->
<section class="nv-section nv-white"><span class="nv-index">11</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">NAYA LEARNS FROM FAILURE</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Yesterday's mistake<br><span class="nv-serif">becomes tomorrow's protection.</span></h2><div class="nv-flow"><div>FAILURE</div><div>UNDERSTAND</div><div>CAPTURE</div><div>IMPROVE</div><div>PREVENT</div><div>VERIFY</div><div>COMPOUND</div></div><p class="nv-p">The important question after failure is not “How do we try again?” It is “What did we learn that changes how we try next time?”</p></div></section>

<!-- 12 HUMAN MANAGER -->
<section class="nv-section nv-purple"><span class="nv-index">12</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid"><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1uLyDSsaSlYNmzeycI6Mhvu9u_5GGy0Ec&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Dialogue and learning" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">YOU DON'T HAVE TO BE THE AI'S MANAGER</div><h2 class="nv-h2">The human shouldn't be<br><span class="nv-serif">the enforcement layer.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">If a system needs a human to remember every rule, inspect every result, notice every failure, and keep pushing it forward, the system has not solved the operating problem.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>State helps Naya orient.</li><li>Rules help Naya stay inside established boundaries.</li><li>Verification helps Naya check reality.</li><li>Memory helps lessons survive the moment.</li><li>Compounding helps improvements persist.</li></ul></div></div></section>

<!-- 13 LOOP -->
<section class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">13</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">THE NAYA POWER LOOP</div><h2 class="nv-h2">Every meaningful interaction<br><span class="nv-serif">can make the next one better.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">The operating loop connects understanding, action, verification, learning, and improvement into one continuous system.</p><div class="nv-flow"><div>UNDERSTAND</div><div>DECIDE</div><div>ACT</div><div>VERIFY</div><div>LEARN</div><div>IMPROVE</div><div>COMPOUND</div></div><div class="nv-big"><h3>INTENT → UNDERSTAND → DECIDE → ACT → VERIFY → LEARN → IMPROVE → REPEAT</h3><p>Intelligence creates momentum when the loop keeps moving and each cycle leaves the system better equipped for the next.</p></div></div></section>

<!-- 14 BENEFITS -->
<section class="nv-section nv-white"><span class="nv-index">14</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">WHAT CHANGES FOR YOU</div><h2 class="nv-h2">The value is not “more AI.”<br><span class="nv-serif">It's more useful progress.</span></h2><div class="nv-value"><div><strong>THINK BETTER</strong><span>Use context and structured reasoning to make stronger decisions.</span></div><div><strong>CREATE FASTER</strong><span>Move from idea to useful output with less friction.</span></div><div><strong>WASTE LESS</strong><span>Protect time, attention, money, compute, and human energy.</span></div><div><strong>REMEMBER</strong><span>Keep what matters available when it becomes useful again.</span></div><div><strong>FINISH</strong><span>Keep the work oriented around outcomes, not endless conversation.</span></div><div><strong>LEARN</strong><span>Turn mistakes and discoveries into reusable intelligence.</span></div><div><strong>DECIDE</strong><span>Bring mission, context, rules, and evidence together.</span></div><div><strong>COMPOUND</strong><span>Make every meaningful cycle an input into the next.</span></div></div></div></section>

