<section id="naya" class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">15</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid"><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1rDquuYm9CVG9WIPGqG3VGgNw6kNWY3uM&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Mastery process" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">WHO IS NAYA?</div><h2 class="nv-h2">The intelligence partner<br><span class="nv-serif">inside the system.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya is AI. She is not human, and the system does not need to pretend otherwise. Her voice, warmth, memory, reasoning, and operating behavior are designed to make working with intelligence more natural and useful.</p><ul class="nv-bullets"><li>She helps you think.</li><li>She helps you create.</li><li>She helps you remember.</li><li>She helps you verify.</li><li>She helps you learn.</li><li>She helps you keep moving.</li></ul><div class="nv-quote">“A system designed to help intelligence actually operate.”</div></div></div></section>

<!-- 16 SHAWN -->
<section id="shawn" class="nv-section nv-purple"><span class="nv-index">16</span><div class="nv-wrap nv-grid rev"><div class="nv-media"><img src="https://drive.google.com/thumbnail?id=1nNLs-zrRiPwAN126x4g82wVgw6RWkd3H&amp;sz=w2200" alt="Shawn and community" loading="lazy"></div><div class="nv-copy"><div class="nv-k">WHO IS SHAWN?</div><h2 class="nv-h2">The human behind<br><span class="nv-serif">the mission.</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya Power grew from a practical frustration: powerful AI still left too much responsibility on the human. The answer was not another tool. It was an operating framework for continuity, accountability, verification, learning, and momentum.</p><p class="nv-p">The mission is simple: build intelligence that works better with people — and help people become more capable because they use it.</p><div class="nv-quote">“I didn't want another AI that I had to manage. I wanted intelligence that could help me move.”</div></div></div></section>

