<section id="capabilities" class="nv-section nv-dark"><span class="nv-index">17</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">FROM CONVERSATION TO CAPABILITY</div><h2 class="nv-h2">What can Naya Power<br><span class="nv-serif">actually do?</span></h2><p class="nv-p">This is the section a new visitor should be able to understand in seconds. These are not decorative labels. They are the major capability areas of the system.</p><div class="nv-cap-wrap"><div class="nv-cap-grid">
