<div class="nv-cap"><span class="nv-cap-num">03</span><div class="nv-cap-icon">◎</div><h3>TALK</h3><p>Use natural conversation as an interface to the intelligence system.</p><ul><li>Think out loud</li><li>Clarify intent</li><li>Challenge assumptions</li><li>Decide together</li></ul><span class="nv-cap-tag">Connection · Dialogue</span></div>
<div class="nv-cap"><span class="nv-cap-num">04</span><div class="nv-cap-icon">⌁</div><h3>REMEMBER</h3><p>Preserve the moments that should improve what happens next.</p><ul><li>Smart Notes</li><li>Decisions</li><li>Breakthroughs</li><li>Lessons and opportunities</li></ul><span class="nv-cap-tag">Continuity · Memory</span></div>
