<div class="nv-cap"><span class="nv-cap-num">08</span><div class="nv-cap-icon">▶</div><h3>EXECUTE</h3><p>Turn decisions into movement — then verify that movement happened.</p><ul><li>Choose the next action</li><li>Do the work</li><li>Check the result</li><li>Keep momentum alive</li></ul><span class="nv-cap-tag">Action · Momentum</span></div>
