<!-- 18 VISION + INTELLIGENCE REPORTS -->
<section id="briefing" class="nv-section nv-purple"><span class="nv-index">18</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">THE BIGGER VISION</div><h2 class="nv-h2">What if your intelligence<br><span class="nv-serif">had a timeline?</span></h2><p class="nv-p">Naya Power is designed to make intelligence visible across time — not just inside a single conversation.</p><div class="nv-horizons"><div class="nv-horizon"><small>01</small><div class="orb"></div><b>IMMEDIATE</b><h3>Daily</h3><p>What happened. What matters. What was learned. What should happen next.</p></div><div class="nv-horizon"><small>02</small><div class="orb"></div><b>REFLECTION</b><h3>Weekly</h3><p>Patterns, wins, friction, unfinished work, and the strongest next priorities.</p></div><div class="nv-horizon"><small>03</small><div class="orb"></div><b>STRATEGY</b><h3>Monthly</h3><p>Progress, lessons, decisions, opportunities, and where intelligence is compounding.</p></div><div class="nv-horizon"><small>04</small><div class="orb"></div><b>DIRECTION</b><h3>Yearly</h3><p>A larger view of what was built, learned, changed, and what the next chapter demands.</p></div><div class="nv-horizon"><small>05</small><div class="orb"></div><b>LEGACY</b><h3>Lifetime</h3><p>The long arc: experience transformed into an intelligence record that can keep serving the future.</p></div></div><div class="nv-big"><h3>Daily Intelligence Briefing → Weekly → Monthly → Yearly → Lifetime</h3><p>Instead of intelligence disappearing when a chat ends, the system can organize meaningful experience into progressively larger views of your life and work.</p></div></div></section>

<!-- 19 FAQ -->
<section id="faq" class="nv-section nv-white"><span class="nv-index">19</span><div class="nv-wrap"><div class="nv-k">FAQ</div><h2 class="nv-h2">The questions<br><span class="nv-serif">that matter.</span></h2><div class="nv-faq"><details><summary>Is Naya Power another chatbot?</summary><p>No. Naya is the AI intelligence partner; Naya Power is the operating system and framework around continuity, memory, action, verification, learning, and compounding intelligence.</p></details><details><summary>Does Naya remember everything?</summary><p>The goal is not indiscriminate memory. The system is designed around meaningful information that should be intentionally captured and made useful later.</p></details><details><summary>What makes Naya Power different from using ChatGPT or another AI?</summary><p>The emphasis is on the operating loop: understand the mission, use context, act, verify reality, learn from what happened, and improve the next cycle.</p></details><details><summary>Does Naya replace human judgment?</summary><p>No. Naya is designed to strengthen human judgment and reduce unnecessary management work. The human remains the decision-maker where human judgment is required.</p></details><details><summary>How does verification work?</summary><p>Verification means checking the real outcome rather than trusting the source, code, deployment, or appearance of completion. The exact verification mechanism depends on the task.</p></details><details><summary>What is the Daily Intelligence Briefing?</summary><p>It is the beginning of a time-based intelligence layer: a concise view of what happened, what was learned, what matters now, and what should happen next, with larger weekly, monthly, yearly, and lifetime views.</p></details><details><summary>Is everything here already built?</summary><p>Naya Power is an evolving system. Individual capabilities can be built, demonstrated, tested, in development, or part of the longer vision. The important rule is to distinguish evidence from aspiration rather than pretend the two are the same.</p></details></div></div></section>

